      <description>&lt;h2&gt;OpenRamble 0.3.7&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;## Responsive menu bar and hotkey&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The menu bar indicator is now deliberately simple: a steady blue dot while&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;recording, a steady green dot while speech is being processed, and no dot when&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenRamble is ready.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This removes an overly frequent menu bar animation that could consume a full&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CPU core and make both the menu and the global dictation hotkey stop responding.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
